    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"ReactiveStringBasedCassandraQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository.query\"><code>ReactiveStringBasedCassandraQuery</code></a> expects a query method to be annotated with\n<a href=\"../Query.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository\"><code>Query</code></a> with a CQL query. String-based queries support named,\nindex-based and expression parameters that are resolved during query execution.",
      "translation": "一个 <a href=\"ReactiveStringBasedCassandraQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository.query\"><code>ReactiveStringBasedCassandraQuery</code></a> 期望查询方法使用带有 CQL 查询的 <a href=\"../Query.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository\"><code>Query</code></a> 注解进行标注。基于字符串的查询支持在查询执行期间解析命名、基于索引和表达式参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
