      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>queryMethod</code> - <a href=\"ReactiveCassandraQueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository.query\"><code>ReactiveCassandraQueryMethod</code></a> on which this query is based.</dd>\n<dd><code>operations</code> - <a href=\"../../core/ReactiveCassandraOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core\"><code>ReactiveCassandraOperations</code></a> used to perform data access in Cassandra.</dd>\n<dd><code>delegate</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a> used to parse expressions in the query.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>4.4</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"ReactiveCassandraQueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository.query\"><code>ReactiveCassandraQueryMethod</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../core/ReactiveCassandraOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core\"><code>ReactiveCassandraOperations</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
